#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
StormRaven OS: Infinity Protocol v3.9.0 — Windows 11 Edition + Moov AI Command Center
Pure GTK3 X11 desktop application (zero WebKit/QtWebEngine/EGL subprocesses).
Includes full interactive Moov AI Same-Day ACH (.ach NACHA) & Mobile Check Deposit (.x937 mRDC)
with live SQLite ledger balance updates and ABA Mod-10 routing verification.
"""
